{
  "uid": "rifa-logs-trace",
  "title": "Logs para trace",
  "tags": ["rifa", "logs"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Salto pelo trace_id",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "O Alloy envia o stdout de `api` e `worker` ao Loki sem promover `trace_id` a label. No log, o campo derivado **TraceID** (JSON `\"trace_id\":\"…\"` ou logfmt `trace_id=`) abre o trace no Tempo.\n\nMétricas de negócio continuam a cargo da API e ainda não têm nome no código: **http duration**, **reservation tx**, **orders by status**, **queue depth**, **oldest pending**, **tickets assigned**, **generation failures**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "api e worker",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{job=\"rifa-app\", service=~\"api|worker\"}",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Collector: spans enviados ao Tempo",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 6 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(otelcol_exporter_sent_spans_total{job=\"otel-collector-internal\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "spans/s",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Linhas com trace_id",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{job=\"rifa-app\"} |~ \"trace_id\"",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
